MODULE: ReadSnapshotConsistentMixedVersions
TARGET: ReadSnapshotConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A reader certifies a fan-out even when a decision crossed it.
PERTURBS: ReaderOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Capture \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf \/ Validate \/ ReaderIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: skip the crossing-decision validation after fan-out.
    /\ (Capture \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf
        \/ (reader = "validate" /\ reader' = "done" /\ held' = FALSE /\ leaseLeft' = 0
            /\ UNCHANGED <<snapshot, observed, attempts, crossed>>)
        \/ ReaderIdle)
--- END
